# LF Salcus — exclusive Kundennummer field (verified)

When filling Roberta Case Tracker (LF / `fill_case_tracker.py`):

**Salcus is taken from one Sprinklr field only** (currently visible case):

`div[data-entityid="Kundennummer"][aria-label="Kundennummer"]`

That is the sidebar box whose label is **Kundennummer**. The **value inside that box changes every Fall #** — read it fresh each LF. Never reuse a previous case’s number. Do **not** require a fixed `data-errorid`.

## How the value is shown (do not miss a visible number)

| State in that box | Typical DOM | Roberta Salcus | Ticketstatus (Transfer Nein) |
|-------------------|-------------|----------------|-------------------------------|
| Numeric Kundennummer | `[data-testid="htmlText"]` (digits only; may include trailing NBSP) | Fill those digits | **1-Erfolgreich** |
| **Vertragsnummer `C-…`** (e.g. `C-0026448826`) | `[data-testid="htmlText"]` | **Leave empty** — **not Salcus** | **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** |
| Unset | `span.spr-text-03` = **Nicht festgelegt**; no `htmlText` | Leave empty | **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** |

**Verified example:** Fall **#55920431** — Kundennummer box shows **`C-0026448826`**. That is a **Vertragsnummer**, not a Salcus/Kundennummer. Do **not** fill Roberta Salcus with `0026448826` or any digits stripped from the `C-` prefix. Leave Salcus empty → **3 - Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus**.

**Order:** read `htmlText` first inside that box, then `span.spr-text-03` in `.dont-break-out`. A visible number is usually **htmlText**, not `spr-text-03`. Looking only at `spr-text-03` will miss a set Kundennummer.

**Do not** read Kundennummer from email body, Care Webform, Betreff, Freitext, `html-message-content`, other DOM nodes, clipboard, or previous cases.

Ticketstatus “Kundennummer present” means **this field** has a **valid numeric Salcus/Kundennummer** — not a `C-` Vertragsnummer and not a number found in the email.

Full LF spec: `.cursor/rules/lf-log-form.mdc`.
